      "message": "refactor: remove swagger openapi support\n\nThe generated OpenAPI/Swagger layer does not add much value because Cashu\nalready has a protocol spec. The Swagger UI also cannot exercise real wallet\nflows that require wallet-side operations.\n\nRemoving it reduces optional dependency surface, including the Swagger UI asset\ndependency.",
