        "payload": "tree 4ec19d02166cf8a1538deb81914e1b56a17b917c\nparent 069d310a06b99cefeb12fffad9a1e24d56a37687\nauthor thesimplekid <tsk@thesimplekid.com> 1779646840 +0200\ncommitter thesimplekid <tsk@thesimplekid.com> 1779952823 +0200\nchange-id kxomklzrsltoysvvrrovqlzwvmlpmyso\n\nrefactor: remove swagger openapi support\n\nThe generated OpenAPI/Swagger layer does not add much value because Cashu\nalready has a protocol spec. The Swagger UI also cannot exercise real wallet\nflows that require wallet-side operations.\n\nRemoving it reduces optional dependency surface, including the Swagger UI asset\ndependency.\n",
